  message: "Materialized from dogfood tranche 05 (F98.A2 / anon-card-015). Mechanism: usage_contexts metadata emits 'methods' (list) where spec §9.914/§9.928 documents 'http_method' (string). Evidence: frozen substrate.json metadata key probe (0/8 http_method, 8/8 methods) + spec §914/§928; fresh tracker run reproduces. Magnitude: 8/8 usage_contexts (all route records in corpus); consumer following spec gets KeyError/None on every route. Blind severity 4/5, reproduced on frozen substrate + fresh run. NOT_A_DUPLICATE (no existing item covers the usage_contexts metadata method-key schema-vs-spec drift). RELATED to WI-sulaz (done — the Starlette UsageContext extractor that is the producer of this metadata), and adjacent to but distinct from WI-kuvig (WS filed under http_route kind). Carded separately from F98.A1 (the usage: vs uc: id-prefix drift) by the card-writer."  # 20d5
